From 54df250168432c7a72ad82d46be3353a60a2d287 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rick Chen <rick@andestech.com>
Date: Thu, 21 Apr 2022 10:42:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/34] Add Andes specific SBI calls, driver patches and fixes

This patch set includes the following patches:

	MISC:
	ee7614ee07 lib/andes_plic.c: Add priority ipi (#2)
	5d93fa9e11 riscv: Enable openSBI banner print
	03e98fa494 riscv: Fix XIP mode booting failure

	SBI calls:
	7982f27b1f riscv: provide missing base extension functions
	d40faadd5b riscv: Add Andes specific SBI calls

	L2C driver:
	65bd52d056 Add comments for L2C ram cycle settings
	19022c69c5 driver/cache: Add wbinval for cache driver

	MMC driver:
	6c85f48159 mmc: ftsdc010_mci: Support DTS of ftsdc010 driver for generic dma
	8bf95f68ff Disable SD High-Speed capability

Signed-off-by: Rick Chen <rick@andestech.com>
---
